@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Enqueue Fire-and-Forget Email
POST {{host}}/jobs/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "To": "user@example.com",
  "Subject": "Welcome to NexJob",
  "Body": "Background job successfully enqueued!"
}

### 2. Check Job Status (replace with actual GUID)
GET {{host}}/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status

### 3. Schedule Delayed Report (10s delay)
POST {{host}}/jobs/report/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Report": {
    "ReportName": "Q1-Sales",
    "From": "2026-01-01",
    "To": "2026-03-31"
  },
  "DelaySeconds": 10
}

### 4. Create Job Continuation (Report -> Email)
POST {{host}}/jobs/chain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "To": "manager@example.com",
  "Subject": "Quarterly Report Completed",
  "Body": "The sales summary report has completed."
}

### 5. Check Due Recurring Jobs
GET {{host}}/jobs/due-recurring
